WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:02.933
Regarding the Wutu's commander Shilang this time

00:03.320 --> 00:04.480
Do you know anything about him?

00:04.560 --> 00:05.960
Heard from General Zu

00:06.280 --> 00:06.680
This man

00:06.840 --> 00:09.120
Is one of Wutu Zhao's renowned fierce generals

00:09.200 --> 00:10.600
When Yong'an fell that year

00:10.680 --> 00:11.600
He led only dozens of cavalry

00:11.680 --> 00:13.080
Charged into the city

00:13.400 --> 00:15.120
Single-handedly made tens of thousands of defenders

00:15.200 --> 00:16.600
Tremble and flee

00:16.800 --> 00:17.720
In recent years

00:17.800 --> 00:19.120
He has had few defeats

00:19.200 --> 00:20.120
However

00:20.200 --> 00:21.000
This Shilang

00:21.080 --> 00:21.640
Despite this

00:21.720 --> 00:22.840
With illustrious military achievements

00:22.920 --> 00:23.760
Now

00:23.840 --> 00:25.480
Is only a Left General

00:25.560 --> 00:26.960
All because his mother

00:27.200 --> 00:29.200
Was a captured Xuan woman slave

00:29.400 --> 00:30.800
Making his origins lowly

00:30.920 --> 00:32.000
In the Wutu Zhao court

00:32.080 --> 00:33.480
He is suppressed everywhere

00:33.840 --> 00:35.000
That can only make him

00:35.080 --> 00:36.480
More cunning

00:36.960 --> 00:38.320
Because he

00:38.400 --> 00:39.680
Cannot afford mistakes

